{"id":"n13955-1-3","stage":2,"title":"시내버스 · 市内公交车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13955-1-3-1","ko":"박물관까지 가려면 어떻게 해야 하나요?","zh":"去博物馆要怎么走呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"박물관까지","meaning":"博物馆","explanation":"박물관：博物馆；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"박물관","audio":"/audio/9c844c75334ef5795590.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36677","senseId":"1","lemma":"박물관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"박물관까지","audio":"/audio/0426334e7a487e65a1ca.mp3"}},{"text":"가려면","meaning":"去（博物馆）","explanation":"가다：去（博物馆）；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려면","audio":"/audio/fde17e82c40c3f9f5bb6.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"해야","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야","audio":"/audio/c8f942c39d369acda96c.mp3"}},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나요","audio":"/audio/208badeaa54755540b4c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9c844c75334ef579","term":"박물관","zh":"博物馆","audio":"/audio/9c844c75334ef5795590.mp3","entryId":"36677","definition":"搜集、保存和陈列文物或艺术品以供人们欣赏或研究的设施。","pronunciation":["방물관"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去（博物馆）","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"去（博物馆）","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/be968ebb244533d2e5b8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n13955-1-3-2","ko":"저 앞에 보이는 정류장에서 시내버스를 타세요.","zh":"在前面看到的那个公交站搭乘市内公交车就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는","meaning":"能看见的","explanation":"보이다：能看见的；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"1","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는","audio":"/audio/401b2c331fa5766871a6.mp3"}},{"text":"정류장에서","meaning":"车站","explanation":"정류장：车站；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"정류장","audio":"/audio/888da7692e098e28c0f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62519","senseId":"1","lemma":"정류장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정류장에서","audio":"/audio/41e83492d102a169d67c.mp3"}},{"text":"시내버스를","meaning":"市内公交车，市区公共汽车","explanation":"시내버스：市内公交车，市区公共汽车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시내버스","audio":"/audio/b496d23825510edeec5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13955","senseId":"1","lemma":"시내버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시내버스를","audio":"/audio/99d92358cc70ad89ccd0.mp3"}},{"text":"타세요.","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타세요","audio":"/audio/970fc2b15bbc8387ee78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"能看见的","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"能看见的","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"888da7692e098e28","term":"정류장","zh":"车站","audio":"/audio/888da7692e098e28c0f2.mp3","entryId":"62519","definition":"为让人上下车，汽车或出租车等停车的地方。","pronunciation":["정뉴장"]},{"id":"b496d23825510ede","term":"시내버스","zh":"市内公交车，市区公共汽车","audio":"/audio/b496d23825510edeec5d.mp3","entryId":"13955","definition":"城市里按照规定线路运行的公交车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0e0092c683c62d3a2fb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=13955","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","d